			description: [
				"The &cNether&r is a realm of immense power and peril-but in this world, its gates are sealed."
				""
				"Unlike traditional Minecraft, you cannot simply ignite obsidian and step through.  "
				"Instead, you must embark on a journey across the Overworld, seeking out ancient structures that guard the keys to the underworld’s fiery threshold."
				""
				"Each ruin holds &6valuable loot&r and clues-fragments of a puzzle that, when assembled, unlock the &lSeal of the Underworld&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
