		{
			dependencies: ["5EDC9934E7D346D8"]
			description: [
				" &2The Overworld&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/overworld_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &2Overworld&r is more than your first step-it's the beating heart of your journey through &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.  "
				"From that first tree you punch to the moment you forge your first machine, every milestone begins here, in a land teeming with life, danger, and untapped potential."
				""
				"Explore lush forests, windswept plains, and winding cave systems as you gather resources, build your first shelter, and lay the groundwork for the adventures ahead.  "
				"Whether you're crafting your first stone pickaxe or forging iron tools beneath a mountain outpost, the Overworld sets the stage for the trials to come."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l From Survival to Mastery&r  "
				"Your time in the Overworld isn’t just about collecting materials-it’s about building resilience.  "
				"Cook hearty meals, manage your health, and defend against the monsters of the night.  "
				"Establish farms, secure your base, and experiment with early automation as you progress toward advanced crafting and complex contraptions."
				""
				"Each crafted item and conquered danger brings you one step closer to unlocking the greater mysteries of the world."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l The Journey Begins Here&r  "
				"This is where legends are forged.  "
				"With every block placed and battle won, you grow stronger, smarter, and more prepared for what lies beyond."
				""
				"But never forget: the Overworld is not just a place-it’s a proving ground.  "
				"&nMaster it, and you’ll be ready for the realms that follow.&r "
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:grass_block"
			id: "5DA842A1588FB8BE"
			rewards: [{
				id: "579D97F778BAF7DC"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Begin your journey in the Overworld and forge the foundation for all that lies ahead. Click me for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				icon: {
					Count: 1
					id: "minecraft:leather_boots"
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
