		{
			dependencies: ["486542BF23253839"]
			description: [
				"&cThe Nether is no ordinary realm-it is a crucible of fire, fury, and forgotten power.&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/nether_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Unlocked through &cNether Remastered&r, this volatile dimension will challenge your survival instincts at every turn.  "
				"Here, rivers of &6lava&r carve through blackened stone, &fghasts&r roam the crimson skies, and ancient &5fortresses&r conceal both peril and prize."
				""
				"But your purpose is greater than survival-&nthis is a conquest of chaos&r.  "
				"Harvest powerful resources, brave brutal landscapes, and triumph over the monsters that thrive in the flames."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Sharpen your blades, fortify your resolve, and embrace the fire.  "
				"&nThe Nether awaits-will you master it, or be consumed by it?&r "
			]
