		{
			dependencies: ["3F3994EDD215FC99"]
			description: [
				"&cYou’ve broken the seal and crossed into the Nether&r-"
				"but this realm of flame is unforgiving, and survival begins the moment you arrive."
				""
				"Your first task is not conquest-it’s &6resource gathering&r."
				""
				"Establish a &esafe perimeter&r, mark your &dportal’s location&r, and begin mining the &cNether’s rich materials&r-quartz, gold, glowstone, and more-to fuel your survival and progress. Stockpile what you can, for every vein you uncover strengthens your foothold in this hostile world."
				""
				"Use the &bLodestone&r and &bCompass&r rewards to anchor your journey and ensure you can always find your way back, even when the twisting caverns threaten to swallow you whole."
				""
				"&nThis is your foothold in the inferno. Mine it, master it, or be consumed by it.&r"
